{
    "format_version": "1.17",
    "minecraft:npc_dialogue": {
        "scenes": [
            {
                "scene_tag": "custode_intro",
                "npc_name": "§0Il Custode",
                "text": "§8Sit down.\n§0Not many stop here.\n§8They usually go to the merchants. Or the Cult.\n§0As if those were different things.",
                "buttons": [
                    {
                        "name": "What do you guard?",
                        "commands": ["/dialogue open @e[tag=custode,r=2] @initiator custode_risposta"]
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "What do you know?",
                        "commands": ["/dialogue open @e[tag=custode,r=2] @initiator custode_main"]
                    }
                ]
            },
            {
                "scene_tag": "custode_risposta",
                "npc_name": "§0Il Custode",
                "text": "§8Memory.\n§0This village has a long history.\n§8Everyone does their best to forget it.\n§0I don't.",
                "buttons": [
                    {
                        "name": "Tell me.",
                        "commands": ["/dialogue open @e[tag=custode,r=2] @initiator custode_main"]
                    }
                ]
            },
            {
                "scene_tag": "custode_main",
                "npc_name": "§0Il Custode",
                "text": "§8What do you want to know?",
                "buttons": [
                    {
                        "name": "The Cult",
                        "commands": ["/dialogue open @e[tag=custode,r=2] @initiator custode_culto"]
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "The Merchants",
                        "commands": ["/dialogue open @e[tag=custode,r=2] @initiator custode_mercanti"]
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "Old Piero",
                        "commands": ["/dialogue open @e[tag=custode,r=2] @initiator custode_piero"]
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "Maga Vera",
                        "commands": ["/dialogue open @e[tag=custode,r=2] @initiator custode_vera"]
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "The Secret",
                        "commands": ["/dialogue open @e[tag=custode,r=2] @initiator custode_segreto"]
                    }
                ]
            },
            {
                "scene_tag": "custode_culto",
                "npc_name": "§0Il Custode",
                "text": "§0Before the merchants, there was only the Cult.\n§8Want iron? You had to offer something.\n§0Not gems. Not gold.\n§8Something you can't buy back.",
                "buttons": [
                    {
                        "name": "What did they offer?",
                        "commands": ["/dialogue open @e[tag=custode,r=2] @initiator custode_culto_2"]
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "§0« Back",
                        "commands": ["/dialogue open @e[tag=custode,r=2] @initiator custode_main"]
                    }
                ]
            },
            {
                "scene_tag": "custode_culto_2",
                "npc_name": "§0Il Custode",
                "text": "§8Time. Labor. Secrets.\n§0Sometimes, people.\n§8The Cult called these things missions.\n§0They still do.\n§8Habits die hard.",
                "buttons": [
                    {
                        "name": "§0« Back",
                        "commands": ["/dialogue open @e[tag=custode,r=2] @initiator custode_main"]
                    }
                ]
            },
            {
                "scene_tag": "custode_mercanti",
                "npc_name": "§0Il Custode",
                "text": "§0Francesco arrived first.\n§8He brought gems. He brought fixed prices.\n§0He brought choice.\n§8The Cult will never forgive him.\n§0Francesco knows. He smiles anyway.",
                "buttons": [
                    {
                        "name": "And the others?",
                        "commands": ["/dialogue open @e[tag=custode,r=2] @initiator custode_mercanti_2"]
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "§0« Back",
                        "commands": ["/dialogue open @e[tag=custode,r=2] @initiator custode_main"]
                    }
                ]
            },
            {
                "scene_tag": "custode_mercanti_2",
                "npc_name": "§0Il Custode",
                "text": "§8Mastro Ugo forged for the Cult.\n§0One day he stopped, without explanation.\n§8Zio Beppe never understood politics.\n§0He's probably the wisest of all.",
                "buttons": [
                    {
                        "name": "§0« Back",
                        "commands": ["/dialogue open @e[tag=custode,r=2] @initiator custode_main"]
                    }
                ]
            },
            {
                "scene_tag": "custode_piero",
                "npc_name": "§0Il Custode",
                "text": "§0The Cult wanted the ocean monument.\n§8Piero said no.\n§0The next night, he went out on a boat with his family.\n§8Only he came back.\n§0He says it was the sea.\n§8Maybe he was right.",
                "buttons": [
                    {
                        "name": "Was it the Cult?",
                        "commands": ["/dialogue open @e[tag=custode,r=2] @initiator custode_piero_2"]
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "§0« Back",
                        "commands": ["/dialogue open @e[tag=custode,r=2] @initiator custode_main"]
                    }
                ]
            },
            {
                "scene_tag": "custode_piero_2",
                "npc_name": "§0Il Custode",
                "text": "§8I don't know.\n§0I'll never know.\n§8Piero fishes every day in the same spot.\n§0As if waiting for an answer.\n§8The sea doesn't answer.",
                "buttons": [
                    {
                        "name": "§0« Back",
                        "commands": ["/dialogue open @e[tag=custode,r=2] @initiator custode_main"]
                    }
                ]
            },
            {
                "scene_tag": "custode_vera",
                "npc_name": "§0Il Custode",
                "text": "§0Vera was the Cult's alchemist.\n§8The best they ever had.\n§0One day she opened her own shop.\n§8She said she was tired of working for others.\n§0The Cult calls her a traitor.\n§8She charges the highest prices in the village.",
                "buttons": [
                    {
                        "name": "What is she hiding?",
                        "commands": ["/dialogue open @e[tag=custode,r=2] @initiator custode_vera_2"]
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "§0« Back",
                        "commands": ["/dialogue open @e[tag=custode,r=2] @initiator custode_main"]
                    }
                ]
            },
            {
                "scene_tag": "custode_vera_2",
                "npc_name": "§0Il Custode",
                "text": "§8She knows why the Cult's rituals stopped working.\n§0She knows what made them work before.\n§8She'll never tell.\n§0Some things are worth more than gems.",
                "buttons": [
                    {
                        "name": "§0« Back",
                        "commands": ["/dialogue open @e[tag=custode,r=2] @initiator custode_main"]
                    }
                ]
            },
            {
                "scene_tag": "custode_segreto",
                "npc_name": "§0Il Custode",
                "text": "§0Beneath the village there are older foundations.\n§8Marco found them. He doesn't talk about it.\n§0The Cult's rituals weren't just tradition.\n§8Something was listening.\n§0Then it stopped.\n§8No one knows why.\n§0Maybe that's a good thing.",
                "buttons": [
                    {
                        "name": "What will happen?",
                        "commands": ["/dialogue open @e[tag=custode,r=2] @initiator custode_futuro"]
                    },
                    {
                        "name": "§0« Back",
                        "commands": ["/dialogue open @e[tag=custode,r=2] @initiator custode_main"]
                    }
                ]
            },
            {
                "scene_tag": "custode_futuro",
                "npc_name": "§0Il Custode",
                "text": "§8I don't know.\n§0The merchants still sell.\n§8The Cult still assigns missions.\n§0Piero still fishes.\n§8And something, somewhere,\n§0is still waiting.",
                "buttons": [
                    {
                        "name": "§0« Back",
                        "commands": ["/dialogue open @e[tag=custode,r=2] @initiator custode_main"]
                    }
                ]
            }
        ]
    }
}
